# Picking YouTube videos on YouTube's own site, with no key and no yt-dlp
# (the usual config): !yt offers "Pick on YouTube", which opens the picker
# (YouTube's search in a window of lantern's, moved to the dashboard's
# screen), and what is picked there lists under YouTube. A script can't
# click inside YouTube's page, so `picked ID` tells lantern what such a
# click would. Needs the network. The picker window is shot as
# NAME-picker.png.
wait 1500
type !yt sublime gracia
press enter
wait 1500
shot 1-no-key
pick-on-youtube
wait 9000
shot 2-picker
picked jNQXAC9IVRw
picked aqz-KE-bpKQ
wait 4000
shot 3-picked
